        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Fall River Heritage State Park, Battleship Cove\n- Products: Memorial Bridge, USS Massachusetts (BB-59)\n- Topics: World War II, South Dakota-class battleships\n\nFacts:\n- Fall River Heritage State Park includes Memorial Bridge on Battleship Cove, which is home to the World War II battleship USS Massachusetts.\n- USS Massachusetts (BB-59) was known as \"Big Mamie\" to its crewmembers during World War II.\n- USS Massachusetts (BB-59) was a battleship of the second South Dakota class.",
